<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.50 lower. Trading was slow. Top $55.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs    55.00-55.50</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $5.00. Top $54.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3     300-450 lbs   45.50-46.00</p>
<p>Some US 1-2 400-450 lbs 46.50-46.75</p>
<p>		   450-500 lbs   47.50</p>
<p>		   500-550 lbs   50.00</p>
<p>		   550-650 lbs   53.00-54.00</p>
</text>
